<title>NETHERLANDS: Reuters'15th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market.</title>
<headline>Reuters'15th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>This is Reuters' 15th ex-Amsterdam air cargo market report. It will be published regularly until a new version is published at a later date.</p>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Amsterdam Dutch guilder air cargo market rates per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>						  Aug 24    vs	Aug 9</p>
<p>		   UNITED STATES</p>
<p>AMS-JFK					  1.00		 1.05</p>
<p>AMS-LAX					  1.80		 1.85</p>
<p>AMS-CHI					  1.15		 1.25</p>
<p>		    ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p>AMS-HKG					  2.45		 2.45</p>
<p>AMS-SIN					  2.20		 2.20</p>
<p>AMS-NRT					  4.15		 4.10</p>
<p>AMS-TPE					  2.45		 2.50</p>
<p>AMS-SEL					  3.60		 3.60</p>
<p>AMS-KUL					  2.55		 2.50</p>
<p>		     MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>AMS-DXB					  1.55		 1.55</p>
<p>AMS-BAH					  2.10		 2.10</p>
<p>AMS-MCT					  2.45		 2.50</p>
<p>AMS-AUH					  1.85		 1.85</p>
<p>		   LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p>AMS-MEX					  3.70		 3.65</p>
<p>AMS-BOG					  3.50		 3.50</p>
<p>AMS-SCL					  5.50		 5.45</p>
<p>AMS-RIO					  5.00		 5.00</p>
<p>					   AFRICA</p>
<p>AMS_JNB					  3.65		 3.70</p>
<p>AMS-NBO					  2.35		 2.35</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in Dutch guilders.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity.</p>
</text>
